<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com/" crossorigin="" />
    <link
      rel="stylesheet"
      href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?display=swap&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700;900&family=Spline+Sans:wght@400;500;600;700"
    />
    
    <title>Contact Usn</title>
    <link rel="icon" type="image/x-icon" href="image/x-icon;base64," />
    
    <script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com?plugins=forms,container-queries"></script>
    <script>
      tailwind.config = {
        theme: {
          extend: {
            colors: {
              'primary': '#c827ec',
              'primary-dark': '#a21cc4',
              'bg-dark': '#171118',
              'bg-card': '#251c27',
              'border-color': '#4f3b54',
              'text-muted': '#b49db9',
              'success': '#10b981',
              'error': '#ef4444',
            },
            boxShadow: {
              'glow': '0 0 20px rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.3)',
              'glow-hover': '0 0 30px rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.5)',
              'card': '0 10px 40px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3)',
              'modal': '0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8)',
            },
            animation: {
              'fadeIn': 'fadeIn 0.6s ease-in-out',
              'slideUp': 'slideUp 0.5s ease-out',
              'pulse-slow': 'pulse 3s cubic-bezier(0.4, 0, 0.6, 1) infinite',
              'modalIn': 'modalIn 0.3s ease-out',
              'modalOut': 'modalOut 0.3s ease-in',
            },
            keyframes: {
              fadeIn: {
                '0%': { opacity: '0' },
                '100%': { opacity: '1' }
              },
              slideUp: {
                '0%': { transform: 'translateY(20px)', opacity: '0' },
                '100%': { transform: 'translateY(0)', opacity: '1' }
              },
              modalIn: {
                '0%': { opacity: '0', transform: 'scale(0.95) translateY(20px)' },
                '100%': { opacity: '1', transform: 'scale(1) translateY(0)' }
              },
              modalOut: {
                '0%': { opacity: '1', transform: 'scale(1) translateY(0)' },
                '100%': { opacity: '0', transform: 'scale(0.95) translateY(20px)' }
              }
            }
          }
        }
      };
    </script>
    
    <style>
      body {
        font-family: 'Inter', 'Spline Sans', sans-serif;
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #171118 0%, #2a1f3d 50%, #171118 100%);
        background-attachment: fixed;
      }
      
      .form-field {
        position: relative;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }
      
      .form-field:focus-within {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
      }
      
      .form-input {
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        background: rgba(37, 28, 39, 0.8);
        backdrop-filter: blur(10px);
      }
      
      .form-input:focus {
        border-color: #c827ec !important;
        box-shadow: 0 0 0 3px rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.1), 0 0 20px rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.2);
        background: rgba(37, 28, 39, 0.95);
      }
      
      .form-input:valid {
        border-color: #10b981;
      }
      
      .form-input:invalid:not(:placeholder-shown) {
        border-color: #ef4444;
      }
      
      .submit-btn {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c827ec 0%, #a21cc4 100%);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        position: relative;
        overflow: hidden;
      }
      
      .submit-btn:hover {
        transform: translateY(-2px);
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.4);
      }
      
      .submit-btn:active {
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      
      .submit-btn::before {
        content: '';
        position: absolute;
        top: 0;
        left: -100%;
        width: 100%;
        height: 100%;
        background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.2), transparent);
        transition: all 0.5s;
      }
      
      .submit-btn:hover::before {
        left: 100%;
      }
      
      .floating-label {
        position: absolute;
        left: 15px;
        top: 50%;
        transform: translateY(-50%);
        background: transparent;
        padding: 0 5px;
        color: #b49db9;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        pointer-events: none;
      }
      
      .form-input:focus + .floating-label,
      .form-input:not(:placeholder-shown) + .floating-label {
        top: 0;
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #c827ec;
        background: #251c27;
      }
      
      .error-message {
        font-size: 12px;
        color: #ef4444;
        margin-top: 5px;
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(-10px);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }
      
      .error-message.show {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
      
      .success-message {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981, #059669);
        color: white;
        padding: 1rem;
        border-radius: 12px;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: none;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }
      
      .contact-card {
        background: rgba(37, 28, 39, 0.6);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(79, 59, 84, 0.5);
        box-shadow: 0 20px 60px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);
      }
      
      .contact-icon {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c827ec, #a21cc4);
        width: 60px;
        height: 60px;
        border-radius: 50%;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        margin: 0 auto 1.5rem;
        box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.3);
      }

      /* Modal Styles */
      .modal {
        position: fixed;
        inset: 0;
        z-index: 9999;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        padding: 1rem;
        opacity: 0;
        visibility: hidden;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }

      .modal.show {
        opacity: 1;
        visibility: visible;
      }

      .modal-backdrop {
        position: absolute;
        inset: 0;
        background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
      }

      .modal-content {
        position: relative;
        background: rgba(37, 28, 39, 0.95);
        backdrop-filter: blur(20px);
        border: 1px solid rgba(79, 59, 84, 0.8);
        border-radius: 24px;
        box-shadow: 0 25px 50px -12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);
        max-width: 700px;
        width: 100%;
        max-height: 90vh;
        overflow: hidden;
        transform: scale(0.95) translateY(20px);
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
      }

      .modal.show .modal-content {
        transform: scale(1) translateY(0);
      }

      .modal-header {
        background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c827ec, #a21cc4);
        padding: 1.5rem 2rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: between;
        gap: 1rem;
      }

      .modal-body {
        padding: 2rem;
        overflow-y: auto;
        max-height: calc(90vh - 120px);
      }

      .close-btn {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1);
        border: none;
        border-radius: 50%;
        width: 40px;
        height: 40px;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        justify-content: center;
        color: white;
        cursor: pointer;
        transition: all 0.3s ease;
        flex-shrink: 0;
        margin-left: auto;
      }

      .close-btn:hover {
        background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);
        transform: scale(1.1);
      }

      .privacy-section {
        margin-bottom: 2rem;
      }

      .privacy-section h3 {
        color: #c827ec;
        font-size: 1.25rem;
        font-weight: 600;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
        display: flex;
        align-items: center;
        gap: 0.5rem;
      }

      .privacy-section p, .privacy-section li {
        color: #b49db9;
        line-height: 1.6;
        margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
      }

      .privacy-section ul {
        padding-left: 1.5rem;
        margin-bottom: 1rem;
      }

      .privacy-section li {
        margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
      }

      /* Custom scrollbar for modal */
      .modal-body::-webkit-scrollbar {
        width: 6px;
      }

      .modal-body::-webkit-scrollbar-track {
        background: rgba(79, 59, 84, 0.3);
        border-radius: 3px;
      }

      .modal-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb {
        background: rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.6);
        border-radius: 3px;
      }

      .modal-body::-webkit-scrollbar-thumb:hover {
        background: rgba(200, 39, 236, 0.8);
      }
      
      @media (max-width: 768px) {
        .contact-card {
          margin: 1rem;
          padding: 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .modal-content {
          margin: 0.5rem;
          max-height: 95vh;
        }
        
        .modal-header {
          padding: 1rem 1.5rem;
        }
        
        .modal-body {
          padding: 1.5rem;
          max-height: calc(95vh - 100px);
        }
      }
    </style>
</head>

<body class="min-h-screen">
    <%- include('../partials/navbar') %>
    
    <div class="relative flex min-h-screen flex-col overflow-x-hidden pt-20">
        <!-- Background decorative elements -->
        <div class="absolute inset-0 overflow-hidden pointer-events-none">
            <div class="absolute top-20 left-10 w-72 h-72 bg-primary/10 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse-slow"></div>
            <div class="absolute bottom-20 right-10 w-96 h-96 bg-primary/5 rounded-full blur-3xl animate-pulse-slow"></div>
        </div>
        
        <div class="relative flex-1 flex items-center justify-center px-4 py-12">
            <div class="w-full max-w-2xl">
                <!-- Contact Card -->
                <div class="contact-card rounded-3xl p-8 md:p-12 animate-fadeIn">
                    <!-- Header -->
                    <div class="text-center mb-10">
                        <div class="contact-icon animate-slideUp">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="28" height="28" fill="white" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                                <path d="M224,48H32a8,8,0,0,0-8,8V192a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V56A8,8,0,0,0,224,48ZM203.43,64,128,133.15,52.57,64ZM216,192H40V74.19l82.59,75.71a8,8,0,0,0,10.82,0L216,74.19V192Z"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h1 class="text-white text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold mb-4 animate-slideUp">Contact Us</h1>
                        <p class="text-text-muted text-lg leading-relaxed max-w-md mx-auto animate-slideUp">
                            We're here to help! Fill out the form below and we'll get back to you as soon as possible.
                        </p>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Success Message -->
                    <div id="successMessage" class="success-message">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                            <path d="M229.66,77.66l-128,128a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-56-56a8,8,0,0,1,11.32-11.32L96,188.69,218.34,66.34a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/>
                        </svg>
                        <span>Thank you! Your message has been sent successfully.</span>
                    </div>

                    <!-- Contact Form -->
                    <form id="contactForm" class="space-y-8">
                        <!-- Email Field -->
                        <div class="form-field">
                            <div class="relative">
                                <input
                                    type="email"
                                    id="email"
                                    name="email"
                                    placeholder=" "
                                    required
                                    class="form-input w-full h-14 px-4 pt-6 pb-2 rounded-xl border border-border-color bg-bg-card text-white text-base font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-0"
                                />
                                <label for="email" class="floating-label">Email Address</label>
                            </div>
                            <div id="emailError" class="error-message">Please enter a valid email address</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Topic Field -->
                        <div class="form-field">
                            <div class="relative">
                                <select
                                    id="topic"
                                    name="topic"
                                    required
                                    class="form-input w-full h-14 px-4 rounded-xl border border-border-color bg-bg-card text-white text-base font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 appearance-none cursor-pointer"
                                >
                                    <option value="" disabled selected>Select a topic</option>
                                    <option value="general">General Inquiry</option>
                                    <option value="support">Technical Support</option>
                                    <option value="billing">Billing & Payments</option>
                                    <option value="partnership">Partnership</option>
                                    <option value="feedback">Feedback</option>
                                    <option value="other">Other</option>
                                </select>
                                <!-- Custom dropdown arrow -->
                                <div class="absolute inset-y-0 right-4 flex items-center pointer-events-none">
                                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="#b49db9" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                                        <path d="M213.66,101.66l-80,80a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,0l-80-80A8,8,0,0,1,53.66,90.34L128,164.69l74.34-74.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32Z"/>
                                    </svg>
                                </div>
                            </div>
                            <div id="topicError" class="error-message">Please select a topic</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Message Field -->
                        <div class="form-field">
                            <div class="relative">
                                <textarea
                                    id="message"
                                    name="message"
                                    placeholder=" "
                                    required
                                    rows="6"
                                    class="form-input w-full px-4 pt-6 pb-2 rounded-xl border border-border-color bg-bg-card text-white text-base font-medium focus:outline-none focus:ring-0 resize-none"
                                ></textarea>
                                <label for="message" class="floating-label">Message</label>
                            </div>
                            <div id="messageError" class="error-message">Please enter your message (minimum 10 characters)</div>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Submit Button -->
                        <div class="flex justify-center pt-6">
                            <button
                                type="submit"
                                id="submitBtn"
                                class="submit-btn px-8 py-4 rounded-full text-white font-bold text-lg tracking-wide min-w-[200px] disabled:opacity-50 disabled:cursor-not-allowed"
                            >
                                <span id="btnText">Send Message</span>
                                <span id="btnLoader" class="hidden">
                                    <svg class="animate-spin -ml-1 mr-3 h-5 w-5 text-white inline" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
                                        <circle class="opacity-25" cx="12" cy="12" r="10" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="4"></circle>
                                        <path class="opacity-75" fill="currentColor" d="M4 12a8 8 0 018-8V0C5.373 0 0 5.373 0 12h4zm2 5.291A7.962 7.962 0 014 12H0c0 3.042 1.135 5.824 3 7.938l3-2.647z"></path>
                                    </svg>
                                    Sending...
                                </span>
                            </button>
                        </div>

                        <!-- Privacy Policy -->
                        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm text-center pt-4">
                            By submitting, you agree to our 
                            <button type="button" id="privacyPolicyBtn" class="text-primary hover:text-primary-dark underline transition-colors focus:outline-none focus:ring-2 focus:ring-primary focus:ring-opacity-50 rounded">
                                Privacy Policy
                            </button>
                        </p>
                    </form>
                </div>

                <!-- Contact Info Cards -->
                <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-6 mt-12 animate-slideUp">
                    <div class="bg-bg-card/50 backdrop-blur-lg border border-border-color/50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:bg-bg-card/70 transition-all duration-300">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="#c827ec" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                                <path d="M224,48H32a8,8,0,0,0-8,8V192a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V56A8,8,0,0,0,224,48ZM203.43,64,128,133.15,52.57,64ZM216,192H40V74.19l82.59,75.71a8,8,0,0,0,10.82,0L216,74.19V192Z"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Email</h3>
                        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">hello@Clubarea.com</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-bg-card/50 backdrop-blur-lg border border-border-color/50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:bg-bg-card/70 transition-all duration-300">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="#c827ec" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                                <path d="M222.37,158.46l-47.11-21.11-.13-.06a16,16,0,0,0-15.17,1.4,8.12,8.12,0,0,0-.75.56L134.87,160c-15.42-7.49-31.34-23.29-38.83-38.51l20.78-24.71c.2-.25.39-.5.57-.77a16,16,0,0,0,1.32-15.06l0-.12L97.54,33.64a16,16,0,0,0-16.62-9.52A56.26,56.26,0,0,0,32,80c0,79.4,64.6,144,144,144a56.26,56.26,0,0,0,55.88-48.92A16,16,0,0,0,222.37,158.46Z"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Phone</h3>
                        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">+91 90500 XXXXX</p>
                    </div>

                    <div class="bg-bg-card/50 backdrop-blur-lg border border-border-color/50 rounded-2xl p-6 text-center hover:bg-bg-card/70 transition-all duration-300">
                        <div class="w-12 h-12 bg-primary/20 rounded-full flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-4">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="#c827ec" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                                <path d="M128,64a40,40,0,1,0,40,40A40,40,0,0,0,128,64Zm0,64a24,24,0,1,1,24-24A24,24,0,0,1,128,128ZM176,16H80A64,64,0,0,0,16,80v96a64,64,0,0,0,64,64h96a64,64,0,0,0,64-64V80A64,64,0,0,0,176,16Zm48,160a48,48,0,0,1-48,48H80a48,48,0,0,1-48-48V80A48,48,0,0,1,80,32h96a48,48,0,0,1,48,48ZM192,76a12,12,0,1,1-12-12A12,12,0,0,1,192,76Z"/>
                            </svg>
                        </div>
                        <h3 class="text-white font-semibold mb-1">Follow Us</h3>
                        <p class="text-text-muted text-sm">@ClubArea</p>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Privacy Policy Modal -->
    <div id="privacyModal" class="modal">
        <div class="modal-backdrop" id="modalBackdrop"></div>
        <div class="modal-content">
            <div class="modal-header">
                <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
                    <div class="w-8 h-8 bg-white/20 rounded-lg flex items-center justify-center">
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="18" height="18" fill="white" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                            <path d="M208,80H176V56a48,48,0,0,0-96,0V80H48A16,16,0,0,0,32,96V208a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H208a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V96A16,16,0,0,0,208,80ZM96,56a32,32,0,0,1,64,0V80H96ZM208,208H48V96H208V208Zm-68-56a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H124a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h8A8,8,0,0,1,140,152Z"/>
                        </svg>
                    </div>
                    <h2 class="text-white text-xl font-bold">Privacy Policy</h2>
                </div>
                <button class="close-btn" id="closeModal" aria-label="Close modal">
                    <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                        <path d="M205.66,194.34a8,8,0,0,1-11.32,11.32L128,139.31,61.66,205.66a8,8,0,0,1-11.32-11.32L116.69,128,50.34,61.66A8,8,0,0,1,61.66,50.34L128,116.69l66.34-66.35a8,8,0,0,1,11.32,11.32L139.31,128Z"/>
                    </svg>
                </button>
            </div>
            <div class="modal-body">
                <div class="privacy-section">
                    <p class="text-white mb-6 text-lg">
                        <strong>Effective Date:</strong> December 2024
                    </p>
                    <p class="mb-6">
                        At Stitch Design, we respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information. This Privacy Policy explains how we collect, use, disclose, and safeguard your information when you visit our website and use our services.
                    </p>
                </div>

                <div class="privacy-section">
                    <h3>
                        <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 256 256">
                            <path d="M224,152a8,8,0,0,1-8,8H192v16a8,8,0,0,1-16,0V160H152a8,8,0,0,1,0-16h24V128a8,8,0,0,1,16,0v16h24A8,8,0,0,1,224,152ZM56,112H72a8,8,0,0,0,0-16H56a8,8,0,0,0,0,16Zm88,0a8,8,0,0,0-8-8H88a8,8,0,0,0,0,16h48A8,8,0,0,0,144,112Zm0,32a8,8,0,0,0-8-8H56a8,8,0,0,0,0,16h80A8,8,0,0,0,144,144ZM216,40H40A16,16,0,0,0,24,56V200a16,16,0,0,0,16,16H216a16,16,0,0,0,16-16V56A16,16,0,0,0,216,40ZM40,56H216V184H40Z"/>
                        </svg>
                        Information We Collect
                    </h3>
                    <p><strong>Personal Information:</strong> We may collect personal information that you voluntarily provide when you:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>Contact us through our contact form</li>
                        <li>Subscribe to our newsletter</li>
                        <li>Create an account on our platform</li>
                        <li>Use our design services</li>
                    </ul>
                    <p>This may include your name, email address, phone number, company name, and any message content you provide.</p>
                    
                    <p><strong>Automatically Collected Information:</strong> We may automatically collect certain information when you visit our website, including:</p>
                    <ul>
                        <li>IP address and browser information</li>
                        <li>Device and operating system details</li>
                        <li>Pages visited and time spent on our site</li>
                        <li>Referring website information</li>
                    </ul>
                </div>

                <div class="privacy-section">
